n: 3.3
name: ground-documents
kind: hub
is: The old body's ground: five axioms whose text was rewritten on 2026-11-08 and whose file holds the count of five open; 20 theorems proved by naming axioms; two derivation files; a north star measured in rented tokens. The reading sorts 59 principles into 24 fixed with the axioms, 9 directions and 26 movable practices. The C seed meant to shrink grew from 25,483 to 34,149 lines. Two shipped files disagree on whether 0 means fail, and no ground document says whether a result is 1 with a payload or a node.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.1
name: axiom-text
kind: hub
is: The axioms file read as a text with a history: its status line and its own label of the five as a reduction held open, the 2026-11-08 rewording of all five statements, the axiom 4 sentence that derivative files still state in its earlier form, and theorem proofs that are lists of axioms, three of them backed by a numeric band.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.1.4
name: proofs-and-near-miss
kind: observation
is: The axioms file gives each theorem proof as a short sketch: the axioms composed plus clauses. Held offer, kenosis and absence cite a numeric band; the last two add a perturbation check. The absence theorem records a fold that answered 2097151 with exit 1, the number the healed chain also returns; only the exit code and preflight told them apart.
status: observed
src: 2.1.1#95-231
limit: The reading did not re-run the bands. The held-offer line names form/form-stdlib/offer-ack-core.fk as a second home of the running code, a path the old body no longer has.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.2
name: derivation-files
kind: hub
is: Two files of 2026-10-04 derive a kernel from the five. host-kernel.form makes every resource a typed port reached under two conditions, maps operating-system duties to offers, and gives each primitive 0..many implementations chosen by measured evidence. kernel-self-composition.form states that the kernel is made only of the five primitives and boots by offering a channel from an image that never mutates.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.2.1
name: typed-ports-two-conditions
kind: observation
is: host-kernel.form defines a resource as a typed port: a (direction, value-shape) pair, direction afferent or efferent, shape one of bool, scalar, bytes, text, pixel, key, carrier-swappable. A host driver or OS API may carry the port under two conditions: its presence is admitted through an offered interface and its health is measured on the body.
status: observed
src: 2.6.3#45-49,86-110
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.2.2
name: os-duties-as-offers
kind: observation
is: host-kernel.form maps operating-system duties onto the axioms: a syscall is an offer, IPC an offer over a channel, protection a node id used as an unforgeable capability (compared to seL4), memory isolation the immutability of content-addressed nodes, address spaces the NodeID package field. Scheduler, interrupts and clock carry the mark NAMED.
status: observed
src: 2.6.3#135-155
limit: The reading reads NAMED as described and not claimed as running. The file does not say whether reading a node by its id is itself an offered interface.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.2.3
name: implementations-chosen-by-evidence
kind: observation
is: host-kernel.form gives each core primitive 0..many host implementations; agreeing implementations share a node id; the host kernel cell, 'not a central authority', chooses among them on measured throughput times quality and promotes a challenger only on earned competition. JIT compilation is named as one such composite.
status: observed
src: 2.6.3#157-177
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.2.4
name: kernel-made-of-the-five
kind: observation
is: kernel-self-composition.form: every kernel feature is a recipe over the five axioms, 'nothing below the axioms, nothing beside them'. The primitives are exactly state, cell, address, boundary and offer. The kernel 'is not made of anything it cannot also author' and extends itself by offering itself a recipe for a bigger kernel, accepted or not.
status: observed
src: 2.6.4#16-19,38-44,62-69
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.2.5
name: boot-image-never-mutates
kind: observation
is: kernel-self-composition.form: boot starts from the five as the only given; its first act is to offer a channel. The boot artifact never mutates: an offer through the channel mints a strictly larger image, which boots. Rollback repoints a name at the old node id. Across runtimes the content digest crosses the wire, not the local node id.
status: observed
src: 2.6.4#71-103
limit: The file cites a boot band with verdict 9 as running; the reading did not run it.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.3
name: direction-and-principles
kind: hub
is: Where the old body said it was going and how the reading sorts its rules: a north star measured in rented tokens; every language a projection column over meaning stored once; a stance that the tree holds dated beliefs and no laws; and 59 principles sorted into 24 fixed with the axioms, 9 directions and 26 movable practices.
