n: 3.3.3.1
name: north-star-and-its-measure
kind: observation
is: The north star is 'an organic intelligence that runs from the inside out: a minimal kernel, Form-native choice, consented membranes, observable receipts, trust earned and lost by evidence'. Urs's measure, dated 2026-09-18, is 'the minimum rental token spent on the path to full sovereignty'; remote tokens that do the work go to zero.
