n: 3.3.3.3
name: no-laws-dated-beliefs
kind: observation
is: AGENTS.md records Urs's statement of 2026-09-01 that there are no laws: the tree holds currently observed, proven beliefs with freshness stamps; a belief stamped before the ground shifted is owed a re-witness before anything leans on it; living documents carry only what is and where the work goes, and how it got there stays in git.
status: observed
src: 2.1.4#716-722
