n: 3.3.4
name: tensions
kind: hub
is: Where ground documents and running files disagree or leave a gap. The acknowledgment core is 66 lines, yet fail and stop are both read as nothing while a second file reads fail as 0. Nothing carries seven readings. What 1 and node carry is unsettled. The seed grew by a third under a shrink rule. One runtime stands where the derivation allows many. The reading read three definitions of the phase words and none in the axioms.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.4.1
name: ack-encoding-in-66-lines
kind: observation
is: The old offer and acknowledgment core is 66 lines. It tags an acknowledgment four ways: nothing, an interned ZERO node, a ONE node carrying a payload, and a NODE node carrying a counter-offer. A pending value is the pair of a recipe and its arguments; the header leaves scheduling to the carrier. A census counts answered and silent offers apart.
status: observed
src: 2.1.13#2-24,56-60
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.4.2
name: fail-and-stop-read-as-nothing
kind: observation
is: In the old core oac-failed? and oac-stopped? are both defined as oac-nothing?, and oac-choice moves to the next option on a caught fail. A teaching file lists attempt, choice, backtrack, try, fail, stop, cut, store, restore, undo, timeout, lanes and hold as thin expressions over the one offer; in its backtrack a 1 or a 0 ends the walk.
status: observed
src: 2.1.13#27-35 2.6.8#23-38
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.3.4.3
name: minimal-surface-reads-zero-as-fail
kind: observation
is: minimal-surface.fk (35 lines) offers four door families: INTERN (a leaf and a two-child composition), OBSERVE (read a composition back), OFFER (acknowledgments nothing, 0, 1, node, threading, choice) and PORT (text out and in over the filesystem). Its comment says 'choice pops on fail = ack-0', and ms-choice(a, b) returns b when a equals 0.
status: observed
src: 2.6.9#8-18,32
at: 2026-11-24

