name: keep
kind: hub
is: Eight things the reading carries forward: the 2026-11-08 axiom text with its open count; one offer with a closed acknowledgment; a nothing that computation refuses, with its reason beside it; immutable nodes under free names; a numeric pivot under every language; typed ports and four door families; self-update and boot as ordinary offers; and dated beliefs in place of laws.
