name: keep-names-as-the-only-mutable-layer
kind: finding
is: Carry content-addressed immutable nodes with names as the only mutable layer: undo and versioning are repointing a name, version history is the lineage of ids a name pointed at, and what no name reaches is reclaimed, so the collector belongs to axiom 3 with the names as its roots. A byte the substrate can regenerate is a lease and may be dropped.
